global gPaused

on exitFrame me
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 1 ............................ <the frame>
  [  4] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <the frame>
  [  6] extcall 2 ............................... go(the frame)
  [  8] ret
end

on keyDown
  [  0] pusharglist 0 ........................... <>
  [  2] thebuiltin 9 ............................ <the keyCode>
  [  4] pushint8 35 ............................. <35>
  [  7] eq ...................................... <the keyCode = 35>
  [  8] jmpifz [119] ............................ if the keyCode = 35 then
  [ 11] getglobal 10 ............................ <gPaused>
  [ 13] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 16] eq ...................................... <gPaused = 1>
  [ 17] jmpifz [ 70] ............................ if gPaused = 1 then / else
  [ 20] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 21] setglobal 10 ............................ gPaused = 0
  [ 23] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 26] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 28] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(1)>
  [ 30] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(1)>
  [ 32] objcall 26 .............................. sound(1).play()
  [ 34] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 37] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [ 39] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(2)>
  [ 41] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(2)>
  [ 43] objcall 26 .............................. sound(2).play()
  [ 45] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [ 48] pusharglist 1 ........................... <3>
  [ 50] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(3)>
  [ 52] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(3)>
  [ 54] objcall 26 .............................. sound(3).play()
  [ 56] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [ 59] pusharglist 1 ........................... <4>
  [ 61] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(4)>
  [ 63] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(4)>
  [ 65] objcall 26 .............................. sound(4).play()
  [ 67] jmp [119]
  [ 70] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 73] setglobal 10 ............................ gPaused = 1
  [ 75] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 78] pusharglist 1 ........................... <1>
  [ 80] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(1)>
  [ 82] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(1)>
  [ 84] objcall 27 .............................. sound(1).pause()
  [ 86] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 89] pusharglist 1 ........................... <2>
  [ 91] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(2)>
  [ 93] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(2)>
  [ 95] objcall 27 .............................. sound(2).pause()
  [ 97] pushint8 3 .............................. <3>
  [100] pusharglist 1 ........................... <3>
  [102] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(3)>
  [104] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(3)>
  [106] objcall 27 .............................. sound(3).pause()
  [108] pushint8 4 .............................. <4>
  [111] pusharglist 1 ........................... <4>
  [113] extcall 25 .............................. <sound(4)>
  [115] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <sound(4)>
  [117] objcall 27 .............................. sound(4).pause()
  [119] ret
end
